          </div>
          <div class="metric-row metric-code">
            <span>Complete solution</span>
            <i><b style="--metric: 96%"></b></i>
            <strong>0.96</strong>
          </div>
          <small>Monitoring AUROC · discrimination evidence, not an end-to-end safety guarantee.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

